Usage: recite say [flags] [TEXT...]

Text to verified audio file (default command)

Flags:
  -f PATH
    	read text from PATH
  -file PATH
    	read text from PATH

Global flags:
  -auth-source SOURCE
    	auth SOURCE: auto, codex or file (default auto)
  -codex-bin PATH
    	codex binary PATH
  -codex-home DIR
    	codex home DIR
  -config PATH
    	read config from PATH
  -debug-dir DIR
    	write debug artifacts to DIR
  -json
    	machine-readable output
  -log-file PATH
    	write the log to PATH
  -no-color
    	disable colour
  -profile NAME
    	use config profile NAME
  -q	quiet: errors only
  -quiet
    	quiet: errors only
  -v	verbose (repeatable)
  -verbose
    	verbose (repeatable)
